<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 17:31:39 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a6b8a78af8e7</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今天的太阳。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A bunch of small yellow blossoms in the shade." height="2000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/z428/6a6b8a78af8e7.jpg" width="1122"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://z428.some.pics"&gt;@z428&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 17:31:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a6b829649fe9</link><description>&lt;p&gt;昨天看完《奥德赛》后，我受到启发画了一个独眼巨人。我参考了雷·哈里豪森在《辛巴达第七次航行》中设计的独眼巨人形象。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A hand-drawn sketch of a cartoonish cyclops with greenish, textured skin, a single large eye, pointed ears, a horn on its head, and sharp teeth. The creature is shown from the chest up against a warm tan background, with its mouth open in a playful, snarling expression." height="1730" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6a6b829649fe9.jpg" width="1730"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 16:58:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a6af9ca23848</link><description>&lt;p&gt;摩西凝视 - 罗马 (2018)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="The Moses by Michelangelo, built for the monumental tomb of Pope Julius II." height="2038" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/hiddenflair/6a6af9ca23848.jpg" width="3621"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://hiddenflair.some.pics"&gt;@hiddenflair&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 07:14:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>禁止停泊</title><link>https://some.pics/6a6aed90b0173</link><description>&lt;p&gt;禁止停泊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A yellow marker buoy with an X on top (which is normally used to mark recreational areas such as beaches) and bearing the inscription ‘fortøyning forbudt’ (mooring prohibited) is lying on the shore and is tied to a tree with a rope. " height="3726" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a6aed90b0173.jpg" width="2980"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 06:22:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a6ac5aa2d0c7</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我的另一个弱点……冰淇淋三明治&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A chocolate chip cookie ice cream sandwich, cut in half, sits on a white plate next to a knife, with more cookies in a plastic container in the background." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/ericmwalk/6a6ac5aa2d0c7.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://ericmwalk.some.pics"&gt;@ericmwalk&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 03:31:58 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>